  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\nAll notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.\n\nThe format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/),\nand this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).\n\n## [Unreleased]\n\n## [0.7.0] - 2026-09-15\n\n## [0.6.0] - 2026-09-15\n\n## [0.5.0] - 2026-09-15\n\n### Changed\n\n- Updated to .NET 10\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fix grype lint errors\n\n## [0.4.10] - 2026-09-11\n\n## [0.4.9] - 2026-08-29\n\n## [0.4.3] - 2024-11-15\n\n### Added\n\n- Changelog changed check workflow for pr's\n\n## [0.4.2] - 2024-11-10\n\n### Changed\n\n- Add all dependency `.dll's` to the release\n\n## [0.3.1] - 2024-10-26\n\n### Added\n\n- Release notes to the NuGet Package\n\n## [0.3.0] - 2024-10-20\n\n### Added\n\n- Codecov reporting\n\n## [0.2.0] - 2024-10-10\n\n### Added\n\n- Changelog Automation\n\n## [0.1.7] - 2024-09-28\n\n### Added\n\n- Create many extensions\n\n[Unreleased]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.7.0...HEAD\n\n[0.7.0]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.6.0...v0.7.0\n\n[0.6.0]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.5.0...v0.6.0\n\n[0.5.0]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.4.10...v0.5.0\n\n[0.4.10]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.4.9...v0.4.10\n\n[0.4.9]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.4.3...v0.4.9\n\n[0.4.3]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.4.2...v0.4.3\n\n[0.4.2]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.3.1...v0.4.2\n\n[0.3.1]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.3.0...v0.3.1\n\n[0.3.0]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.2.0...v0.3.0\n\n[0.2.0]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/compare/v0.1.7...v0.2.0\n\n[0.1.7]: https://github.com/TJC-Tools/TJC.VersionExtensions/releases/t